msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/language/kernel/index.rst:21
msgid "Module Contents"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/language/kernel/index.rst:27
msgid ""
"Code inside the launch operates at the block level: ``T.Parallel``, ``T."
"copy`` and friends are mapped onto threads by the compiler. ``T."
"get_thread_binding()`` exposes ``threadIdx`` for thread-level code. The "
"keyword arguments are recorded at trace time and materialized by the CUDA "
"pipeline once the target is known."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/language/kernel/index.rst:0
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/language/kernel/index.rst:33
msgid ""
"Grid extent along each axis (1-3 dimensions, ``gridDim.(x|y|z)``). The "
"launch yields one block index per axis (``blockIdx.(x|y|z)``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/language/kernel/index.rst:36
msgid ""
"Threads per block: a count for ``blockDim.x`` or up to three per-dimension "
"extents for ``blockDim.(x|y|z)``. Defaults to 128 when omitted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/language/kernel/index.rst:40
msgid ""
"CUDA source injected before the generated kernel, e.g. ``#include`` lines or "
"helper functions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/language/kernel/index.rst:43
msgid ""
"Thread block cluster shape (SM90+). ``2`` or ``(2, 1, 1)`` launches 2-CTA "
"clusters via ``cudaLaunchKernelEx``. ``T.ClusterKernel`` is the same launch "
"with a required ``cluster_dims``."
msgstr ""

